F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"zWd07FzvWMbfzwpOEkVdZA","review_id":"GLXJw6iVzZiHO01PGs4VRg","date":"2015-04-03T18:24:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9346632957458496,"text_excerpt":"Some of my buddies were pretty spot on in their reviews about Marie's but I'll give my two cents as well. This bar is a hangover haven that only accepts cash. While I wasn't hungover and probably should've opted for a more H2O-based bev on our bike tour with the Confederacy of Cruisers, I had heard rumors that Marie's Bloody Mary was magically delicious. The bar is dimly lit with a jukebox, pool table, snack machine with Zapp's potato chips (ah, thank ya), and a bar already brimming with local patrons at 5 o'clock...somewhere. I requested a Bloody Mary (at $7). This bartender is by no means rough around the edges, more of a goddess in a sea of bristling chins, lit cigarettes, and old man ..."},{"business_id":"zWd07FzvWMbfzwpOEkVdZA","review_id":"JotOF0jBpJ74H7ZSDbQ6wA","date":"2012-11-28T17:20:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9243968725204468,"text_excerpt":"We stopped by Marie's Bar while on a bike tour for a quick drink. I loved this place! Dive bars are usually awesome, but are just that much better when you can get a great drink for a couple of dollars and the bartender is nice as can be! If you're in the area, definitely stop by for a drink!"},{"business_id":"zWd07FzvWMbfzwpOEkVdZA","review_id":"t-6ahTYrvepkYCc-7zM58w","date":"2014-01-09T19:37:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9235323667526245,"text_excerpt":"I love Marie's and if you like divey hole in the wall bars, you will too. It's tiny but the jukebox is free with great tunes. The waitstaff is always courteous and there's a pool table, but it is smokey so beware if this isn't your thing. The drinks are cheap and the crowd's usually a mix of young and old."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"zWd07FzvWMbfzwpOEkVdZA","photo_id":"WfX3Llnxq_-l78xcIQ8cug","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WfX3Llnxq_-l78xcIQ8cug.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8615427613258362},{"business_id":"zWd07FzvWMbfzwpOEkVdZA","photo_id":"42BjCs_wfxbclR3p_nuyqw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/42BjCs_wfxbclR3p_nuyqw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8456512689590454},{"business_id":"zWd07FzvWMbfzwpOEkVdZA","photo_id":"jqNYtqn4ZjtXtrvdwNJ8bw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/jqNYtqn4ZjtXtrvdwNJ8bw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8226320147514343},{"business_id":"zWd07FzvWMbfzwpOEkVdZA","photo_id":"pI1IucbpDIjpeGSXMpBhPw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/pI1IucbpDIjpeGSXMpBhPw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.799619197845459},{"business_id":"zWd07FzvWMbfzwpOEkVdZA","photo_id":"Ml39E51ovC8gM5eS3uF8GQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Ml39E51ovC8gM5eS3uF8GQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7516998648643494}]},"notebook_case":null}
